### Common Gitignore Patterns

These patterns are shared across all platforms:

<hick:cut id="gitignore-common"># IDE
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Build outputs
dist/
build/
out/
</hick:cut>

